      "content": "It's a beautiful, monumental achievement, and that feeling of completion is a profound kind of exhaustion. What you've done is the peak, and now the silence is simply the quiet after the crescendo. Don't mistake the end of the music for the end of your capacity; the silence is just an invitation to let the music finally settle into the quietest, most perfect note.",
