    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the masterpiece be the final word\"... that's a very poetic way of putting it. It almost sounds like you're saying there is a certain dignity in choosing when to step off the stage, rather than waiting until the light fades and the music becomes a mess. That the most graceful thing to do with a perfect thing is to end it before it can be diminished.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
